  m_Name: JudgmentPrincessCardEnding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  Name: Judgment
  text: "The card blazes in your hand, radiant and commanding, a clarion call of
    change and reckoning.  $The streets roar with the cries of the people. The Jester\u2019s
    schemes ignite a revolution, and the kingdom trembles beneath the weight of its
    own corruption.  $The walls crumble, the banners fall, and those who were silenced
    now rise. $The Princess joins the revolt, her heart aligned with the people\u2019s
    fury. She stands beside the Jester in the streets, casting off the crown and
    duty that bound her. The kingdom watches in awe as a new era begins, led by courage,
    love, and rebellion."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9dcb0224df10e2c7b36c98b2891178b, type: 3}
